{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Sou'wester is a ",["l","帽子","hat"]," that can be purchased from the ",["l","废弃的屋子","Abandoned House"]," for 1,000g after earning the \"Fisherman\" ",["l","成就","Achievement"]," (catch 10 different ",["l","鱼","fish"],"). It can also be obtained from ",["l","沙漠节","Emily's outfit services"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],". There is a ≈2% chance to receive the gender-neutral outfit with the Sou'wester."]]]],["Notes",2,[["l",0,[[1,["The Sou'wester outfit also includes the ",["f","Shirt260.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝","Rain Coat"]," and ",["f","Relaxed_Fit_Pants.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝","Relaxed Fit Pants"]," (dyed RGB value 255,169,2)."]]]]]]]}